WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
This slide is the final completion step for
Assignment 3 The page

00:00:04.638 --> 00:00:08.500
tracks two kinds of required activities ten
knowledge checks and six coding

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:14.612
exercises The overall percentage combines those
sixteen activities Before

00:00:14.638 --> 00:00:19.862
selecting Complete Module look at the counters If
something is incomplete use

00:00:19.888 --> 00:00:23.438
the progress information to return to the missing
activity and finish it

00:00:24.325 --> 00:00:27.138
Your work is saved in this browser on this device so
you

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.812
can move between slides without losing the current
answers under normal use

00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:36.675
When you select Complete Module the page summarizes
your current progress If

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:41.025
all required activities are complete you will have a
completed submission summary

00:00:41.912 --> 00:00:44.950
If some work is still incomplete the page can still
show your

00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:48.650
current responses and SQL code but you should review
what remains before

00:00:48.675 --> 00:00:53.588
submitting unless you intentionally want to submit
incomplete work The Canvas section

00:00:53.612 --> 00:00:56.538
produces a text summary that you can copy and paste
into the

00:00:56.550 --> 00:01:01.588
Assignment 3 text-entry box Before copying it
quickly review the counts and

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:05.900
make sure they match what you expect Remember that
browser storage is

00:01:05.925 --> 00:01:10.938
local Clearing browser data using a private window
or switching to another

00:01:10.962 --> 00:01:14.938
device may not carry this saved progress with you
The main purpose

00:01:14.962 --> 00:01:17.812
of the completion step is to help you verify your
work before

00:01:17.838 --> 00:01:20.250
submission not simply to click a final button
